OL,4,Auntouched for 70 years goes on sale    
OL,5,Awith suitcase still inside             
OL,7,FHowever, its estate agent said the     
OL,8,Fproperty has the potential to be       
OL,9,Ftransformed into something "truly      
OL,10,Findividual", including a home, subject 
OL,11,Fto planning permission.                
